[47.704086, "o", "# The boot volume contains a file called `EncryptedRoot.plist.wipekey`. This is stored on the volume at `/com.apple.boot.X/System/Library/Caches/com.apple.corestorage/EncryptedRoot.plist.wipekey`, where `X` is variable but is often `P` or `R`. This plist file"]
